 "letterboxd-review-1388614253": {
  "guid": "letterboxd-review-1388614253",
  "title": "Twin Peaks",
  "year": 1989,
  "rating": 5.0,
  "like": true,
  "rewatch": false,
  "watched": "2026-07-09",
  "tmdb": 452522,
  "url": "https://letterboxd.com/helmy2005/film/twin-peaks/",
  "review": "No words can express how magnificent this show is. Every character feels alive, and the relationships between them are so rich and unpredictable. The plot constantly rewards your attention, with each revelation making everything that came before even more fascinating. It’s mysterious, emotional and funny unlike anything else ever made. I wish I had watched the series before Fire Walk with Me, because it would have made certain moments hit even harder, but honestly, I have no regrets. Even in that order, the experience was unforgettable. I’m def gonna rewatch it again."
 },
